        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:4bbd538c34d79305",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f3879c862434f5063655a0a009c8434763596d42a7e8003690b5653d60cc42d8",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Join a group excursion to the Argentine side of Iguazú Falls with an English-speaking guide. After the excursion, transfer to the airport for your flight to Buenos Aires.\nOn arrival in Buenos Aires, a driver will take you from the airport to your hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:5c4b4b04493d4d2d",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "914b1ade00071c0aa681b81a94e5bba911023f4fc2b86be37ddfe9dc89f1e158",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Join a group tour of the Argentine side of Iguazú Falls with an English-speaking guide.\nCross the Iguazú River on the Tancredo Neves Bridge to reach the Argentine side. Here, the trails take you directly above and below the falls, giving you a different perspective from the Brazilian side. You'll feel the force of the falling water and have time to enjoy the surrounding natural park. A network of paths and walkways lets you see the falls from remarkably close range."
    },
